        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"fade-section\">\n  <div class=\"fade-image\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0957/2981/1738/files/ChatGPT_Image_Jun_23_2026_11_56_36_PM.webp?v=1794046174\" alt=\"Korean collagen serum for mature skin\" loading=\"lazy\">\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"fade-content\">\n    <h2 class=\"fade-heading\">\n      Made For Mature Skin That's <span class=\"highlight\">Lost Its Bounce</span>\n    </h2>\n\n    <p class=\"fade-text\">\n      Meet the Korean collagen serum made for the dryness, fine lines and tired, deflated look that show up when your skin starts changing.\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"fade-text\">\n      After 40, and especially through menopause, skin loses its ability to hold on to water. Your moisturizer sits on top while the layers underneath stay thirsty, and that is what makes lines look deeper and skin look flat. This lightweight collagen serum goes on first, pulling moisture in and holding it there, so your skin stays cushioned and hydrated all day.\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"fade-text\">\n      Your skin feels softer and looks plumper from the first use, and with every day it stays hydrated, fine lines look smoother and your face looks more rested and full of life.\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"fade-highlights\">\n      <div class=\"highlight-item\">\n        <span class=\"sparkle\">✦</span>\n        <span>Plumps &amp; smooths fine lines</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"highlight-item\">\n        <span class=\"sparkle\">✦</span>\n        <span>Lightweight, never sticky</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .fade-section {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: stretch;\n    gap: 40px;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    max-width: 1200px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    border-top: 3px solid #87ceeb;\n    padding-top: 20px;\n  }\n\n  .fade-image {\n    flex: 1;\n    min-width: 0;\n  }\n\n  .fade-image img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    object-fit: cover;\n    display: block;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n  }\n\n  .fade-content {\n    flex: 1;\n    min-width: 0;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 20px 0;\n  }\n\n  .fade-heading {\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    margin: 0 0 20px 0;\n  }\n\n  .highlight {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4fb3df 0%, #87ceeb 100%);\n    color: #fff;\n    padding: 2px 8px;\n    box-decoration-break: clone;\n    -webkit-box-decoration-break: clone;\n  }\n\n  .fade-text {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    margin: 0 0 16px 0;\n  }\n\n  .fade-highlights {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 24px;\n    margin-top: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .highlight-item {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n\n  .sparkle {\n    color: #4fb3df;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .fade-section {\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 20px;\n    }\n\n    .fade-heading {\n      font-size: 19px;\n      margin-bottom: 14px;\n    }\n\n    .fade-text {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .fade-highlights {\n      gap: 14px;\n    }\n\n    .highlight-item {\n      font-size: 12.5px;\n    }\n\n    .fade-content {\n      padding: 0;\n    }\n  }\n</style>",
